{
    "pr_body": "After adding in https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/pull/78594 a new abstraction for aggregation builders, we can exploit it in the vector tile implementation to add support for any of the aggregations that uses the abstraction. In particular this PR adds support for the following aggregations:\r\n\r\n* `boxplot`\r\n* `extended stats`\r\n* `median absolute deviation`\r\n* `percentile`\r\n* `percentile-rank`\r\n* `stats`\r\n* `value count`\r\n\r\ncloses https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/77072\r\n\r\n",
